n330:## 9. i18n, accessibility and shared primitives\n332:### i18n\n353:### Accessibility\n367:### Shared primitives\n380:## 10. Types\n401:## 11. Tests\n441:## 12. Commit granularity\n456:## 13. Style-characteristics table\n484:## 14. What the human does that the AI doesn't\n501:## 15. What the AI does that the human doesn't\n521:## 16. Where each author deviates from the repo's own conventions\n541:## 17. Summary — how the styles differ\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && wc -l docs/coding-style.md && echo \"--- headings ---\" && grep -n \"^#\" docs/coding-style.md","time":{"start":1791728708350,"end":1791728708384}},"id":"prt_12b5a6a62001wdRF8ODe2bXPLA","sessionID":"ses_ed4aa686fffeRBfsdkp4XPbH5d","messageID":"msg_12b5a5d0e0017QdmkGm3XAY5I8"}}
