3-17`; `groupByDate`\n30: duplicated verbatim in `GroupedEntries.svelte:18-30` and `[id]/+page.svelte:67-79`;\n31: `aria-label` at `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte:184,212,224,245,300,308` and\n32: `ProjectCreate.svelte:102,113`; `PomodoroWidget.svelte` 211 LOC imported nowhere;\n33: dead `TimeTrackingStatisticsRequest`; no `notifications.*` anywhere.\n34: \n35: TASK-3: PASS\n36: notes: Layer-by-layer comparison is supported by the evidence (mixed return\n37: semantics `Todos.svelte.ts:280-317` vs `:331-359`; `$derived(() => …)` misuse\n38: exactly at `DashboardView.svelte:24,35,37,46` + `StatisticsView.svelte:52`;\n39: loading discipline; i18n/a11y reversal; test footprint). One minor\n40: mis-citation: §5 says `weekBreakdown()` is called at `DashboardView.svelte:58,63`\n41: — line 58 is `todayBreakdown()`, line 63 is `weekBreakdown()`. Correct the\n42: citation.\n43: \n44: TASK-4: PASS\n45: notes: Every policy quotation checks out against `docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n46: (comments cite `Todos`, `$derived` discipline), `STATE_SERVICES.md` (Todos as DI\n47: reference, Clipboard as \"older — not the target style\", member ordering, service\n48: delegation, `load()`+`loaded`), `COMPONENTS.md` (local UI state, loading\n49: feedback, primitives, accessibility, i18n), `DATA_LAYER.md` (layout calls\n50: `load()`, no hand-built URLs) and `TESTING.md` (Todos as Priority-1). The §8\n51: claim that `BEST_PRACTICES.md` quotes two `Todos` comments that no longer exist is\n52: true and precisely dated: `git log -S` shows both introduced in `d7d4d92` and\n53: removed in `a34275e`. Minor: §11 asserts TESTING.md names\n54: `TimeTrackingGroupingService` as covered pure logic — TESTING.md does not mention\n55: that service; reword or drop.\n56: \n57: TASK-5: PARTIAL\n58: notes: `docs/coding-style.md` (574 lines) exists, is purely additive, and is\n59: substantively accurate and well-evidenced — but it carries the component-count\n60: error from TASK-1 and the `DashboardView` line mis-citation from TASK-3 in its\n61: own text.\n62: \n63: TASK-6: PASS\n64: notes: `git diff main...HEAD` contains only `docs/coding-style.md` plus the job\n65: artifacts; no `src/**`, `tests/**` or i18n file changed. Every referenced path\n66: exists. `npm run check` was not run; confirmed `node_modules` is absent, so the\n67: documented reason holds and a doc-only change cannot alter the type-check state.\n68: \n69: ## Security\n70: \n71: <!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n72: none — documentation-only change.\n73: \n74: ## Overall\n75: \n76: NEEDS WORK\n77: \n78: Required before merge (all in `docs/coding-style.md`):\n79: 1. Correct the component counts: 34 component files (not 35) and 14 `props/`\n80:    components (not 15) in the §1 metrics table and §4; adjust the component LOC\n81:    total if it was computed over the wrong file set.\n82: 2. Fix the §5 call-site citation — `weekBreakdown()` is at\n83:    `DashboardView.svelte:63` (`:58` is `todayBreakdown()`).\n84: 3. Fix the §11 misquote — `docs/TESTING.md` does not name\n85:    `TimeTrackingGroupingService` as covered pure logic.\n86: \n87: Everything else verified. The report is thorough and its comparative\n88: conclusions hold; only these verifiable-number/citation errors block merge.\n\n(End of file - total 88 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Verdict: analysis: human vs ai coding style\n\nid: image\nreviewer: deepseek-v4-flash (opencode-go)\ndate: 2026-10-11\n\n## Review\n\nTASK-1: PARTIAL\nnotes: Inventory is complete and every cited file/line exists — store DI at\n`Todos.svelte.ts:62-72`, service fields `:57-60`, `SvelteDate` filter pipeline\n`:165-171`, `load()` `:74-97`, `loadWorkspaces` retry `:107-118`,\n`quickCreate {ok,recurrenceIgnored}` `:249-278`; spinner leaks in\n`props/Title.svelte:59-61`, `Description.svelte:93-95`, `Subtask.svelte:66-68`,\n`ListAndAdd.svelte:60-62` (with `Category.svelte:70` as the correct\ncounter-example); hardcoded strings in `