{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791728962458,"sessionID":"ses_ed4a27f91ffeR9dOCXcA8pH3kp","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01_tg2ZpRiTVeBTn2FcTXE83226","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"awk 'NR>=193 && NR<=222 {printf \"%d: %s\\n\", NR, $0}' docs/coding-style.md"},"output":"193: ## 4. View / component decomposition\n194: \n195: - **Human (`todos`)** decomposes along *view mode* and *prop*: four view\n196:   variants (`views/{ListView,CardView,OverviewView,KanbanView}`), a per-field\n197:   `props/` folder (15 tiny components: `Title`, `Category`, `Priority`, …), an\n198:   `actions/` folder (`TodoCreate`, `TodoDelete`, `HideIt`, `SortByScore`) and a\n199:   desktop/mobile navigation split (`TodoNavigationDesktop` 149 LOC /\n200:   `TodoNavigationMobile` 216 LOC). Components are small and single-purpose, at\n201:   the cost of 35 files and some duplication (`getBgColor` is copy-pasted in\n202:   `Card.svelte:31-40` and `CompactCard.svelte:15-24` — allowed by the \"three or\n203:   more times\" DRY rule).\n204: - **AI (`time-tracking`)** decomposes along *screen/role*: one navigation\n205:   component (`TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte`, 363 LOC — the largest file in\n206:   either feature), one entry component, one entry editor, one project editor,\n207:   and one component per dashboard widget. Views are selected by a URL `?tab=`\n208:   param (`routes/time-tracking/+page.svelte:15-19`,\n209:   `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte:31-35`) rather than a component switcher.\n210: \n211: The AI's `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte` concentrates project list, category\n212: CRUD, a colour picker, inline rename, two delete-confirmation modals and the\n213: mobile drawer in one 363-line component. `docs/COMPONENTS.md` §\"Keep the\n214: `<script>` readable … If it stops being scannable, split components\" suggests\n215: the human's instinct (split by concern) is the documented one, though the AI\n216: keeps the file logically sectioned with snippets.\n217: \n218: **Dead code:** `PomodoroWidget.svelte` (211 LOC) is imported nowhere in `src/`\n219: (verified with `grep -rl`). It is the single largest dead-code artifact found in\n220: either feature. The human has no equivalent (the one candidate,\n221: `FindCategoryMenu.svelte`, is used by `settings/WorkspaceEdit.svelte`).\n222: \n","metadata":{"output":"193: ## 4. View / component decomposition\n194: \n195: - **Human (`todos`)** decomposes along *view mode* and *prop*: four view\n196:   variants (`views/{ListView,CardView,OverviewView,KanbanView}`), a per-field\n197:   `props/` folder (15 tiny components: `Title`, `Category`, `Priority`, …), an\n198:   `actions/` folder (`TodoCreate`, `TodoDelete`, `HideIt`, `SortByScore`) and a\n199:   desktop/mobile navigation split (`TodoNavigationDesktop` 149 LOC /\n200:   `TodoNavigationMobile` 216 LOC). Components are small and single-purpose, at\n201:   the cost of 35 files and some duplication (`getBgColor` is copy-pasted in\n202:   `Card.svelte:31-40` and `CompactCard.svelte:15-24` — allowed by the \"three or\n203:   more times\" DRY rule).\n204: - **AI (`time-tracking`)** decomposes along *screen/role*: one navigation\n205:   component (`TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte`, 363 LOC — the largest file in\n206:   either feature), one entry component, one entry editor, one project editor,\n207:   and one component per dashboard widget. Views are selected by a URL `?tab=`\n208:   param (`routes/time-tracking/+page.svelte:15-19`,\n209:   `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte:31-35`) rather than a component switcher.\n210: \n211: The AI's `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte` concentrates project list, category\n212: CRUD, a colour picker, inline rename, two delete-confirmation modals and the\n213: mobile drawer in one 363-line component. `docs/COMPONENTS.md` §\"Keep the\n214: `<script>` readable … If it stops being scannable, split components\" suggests\n215: the human's instinct (split by concern) is the documented one, though the AI\n216: keeps the file logically sectioned with snippets.\n217: \n218: **Dead code:** `PomodoroWidget.svelte` (211 LOC) is imported nowhere in `src/`\n219: (verified with `grep -rl`). It is the single largest dead-code artifact found in\n220: either feature. The human has no equivalent (the one candidate,\n221: `FindCategoryMenu.svelte`, is used by `settings/WorkspaceEdit.svelte`).\n222: \n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"awk 'NR>=193 && NR<=222 {printf \"%d: %s\\n\", NR, $0}' docs/coding-style.md","time":{"start":1791728962380,"end":1791728962420}},"id":"prt_12b5e4ab5001GZH3iiM77Vf2pe","sessionID":"ses_ed4a27f91ffeR9dOCXcA8pH3kp","messageID":"msg_12b5e29c1001fVO0IyCflOGgaV"}}
