Date`\nduplicated verbatim in `GroupedEntries.svelte:18-30` and `[id]/+page.svelte:67-79`;\n`aria-label` at `TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte:184,212,224,245,300,308` and\n`ProjectCreate.svelte:102,113`; `PomodoroWidget.svelte` 211 LOC imported nowhere;\ndead `TimeTrackingStatisticsRequest`; no `notifications.*` anywhere.\n\nTASK-3: PASS\nnotes: Layer-by-layer comparison is supported by the evidence (mixed return\nsemantics `Todos.svelte.ts:280-317` vs `:331-359`; `$derived(() => …)` misuse\nexactly at `DashboardView.svelte:24,35,37,46` + `StatisticsView.svelte:52`;\nloading discipline; i18n/a11y reversal; test footprint). One minor\nmis-citation: §5 says `weekBreakdown()` is called at `DashboardView.svelte:58,63`\n— line 58 is `todayBreakdown()`, line 63 is `weekBreakdown()`. Correct the\ncitation.\n\nTASK-4: PASS\nnotes: Every policy quotation checks out against `docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n(comments cite `Todos`, `$derived` discipline), `STATE_SERVICES.md` (Todos as DI\nreference, Clipboard as \"older — not the target style\", member ordering, service\ndelegation, `load()`+`loaded`), `COMPONENTS.md` (local UI state, loading\nfeedback, primitives, accessibility, i18n), `DATA_LAYER.md` (layout calls\n`load()`, no hand-built URLs) and `TESTING.md` (Todos as Priority-1). The §8\nclaim that `BEST_PRACTICES.md` quotes two `Todos` comments that no longer exist is\ntrue and precisely dated: `git log -S` shows both introduced in `d7d4d92` and\nremoved in `a34275e`. Minor: §11 asserts TESTING.md names\n`TimeTrackingGroupingService` as covered pure logic — TESTING.md does not mention\nthat service; reword or drop.\n\nTASK-5: PARTIAL\nnotes: `docs/coding-style.md` (574 lines) exists, is purely additive, and is\nsubstantively accurate and well-evidenced — but it carries the component-count\nerror from TASK-1 and the `DashboardView` line mis-citation from TASK-3 in its\nown text.\n\nTASK-6: PASS\nnotes: `git diff main...HEAD` contains only `docs/coding-style.md` plus the job\nartifacts; no `src/**`, `tests/**` or i18n file changed. Every referenced path\nexists. `npm run check` was not run; confirmed `node_modules` is absent, so the\ndocumented reason holds and a doc-only change cannot alter the type-check state.\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\nnone — documentation-only change.\n\n## Overall\n\nNEEDS WORK\n\nRequired before merge (all in `docs/coding-style.md`):\n1. Correct the component counts: 34 component files (not 35) and 14 `props/`\n   components (not 15) in the §1 metrics table and §4; adjust the component LOC\n   total if it was computed over the wrong file set.\n2. Fix the §5 call-site citation — `weekBreakdown()` is at\n   `DashboardView.svelte:63` (`:58` is `todayBreakdown()`).\n3. Fix the §11 misquote — `docs/TESTING.md` does not name\n   `TimeTrackingGroupingService` as covered pure logic.\n\nEverything else verified. The report is thorough and its comparative\nconclusions hold; only these verifiable-number/citation errors block merge.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":88,"totalLines":88,"truncated":false}},"title":"docs/jobs/image_analysis-human-vs-ai-coding-style/verdict.md","time":{"start":1791729090180,"end":1791729090215}},"id":"prt_12b603de5001o5kJTag5Uh3fAi","sessionID":"ses_ed49ff389ffeIt68XBPiOrs69A","messageID":"msg_12b603556001uSf6mx8fqcC42v"}}
